WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 35 - Aldis and Orgeld

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:41.450
The tale is set in a small northern country called Lastonia.

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:43.670
Two princesses claim that the ruling king is their father,

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:45.730
but they were born from different mothers.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:50.690
Aldis is refined and beautiful,

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:57.350
while Orgeld grew up destitute in a dungeon.

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:02.840
I can do this. I can play Orgeld!

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:10.190
It's as though they wrote this role just for you!

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.370
Oh, come on!

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:19.020
I know I can play Princess Aldis.

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.000
Nittei Theater.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:23.770
Okay, so now we need to discuss the costumes.

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:24.780
What?

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:32.480
Ms. Tsukikage? Is there a reason you're here?

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:36.460
Yes. I have a proposal.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:41.260
I'm sorry!

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:55.500
The Two Princesses

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.810
Thank you for your patience!

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:55.510
We shall now announce the lineup!

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:01.000
We'll start with the roles of the two princesses.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.430
Princess Orgeld will be played by Ayumi Himekawa.

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:10.970
Princess Aldis will be played by Maya Kitajima.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:14.720
They can't be serious!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.770
There must be some mistake!

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:16.740
It's crystal clear that they've miscast the roles!

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.700
If we can please have your attention.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:23.020
We have made the decision in the hope that these two...

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:26.190
will add their own personal touches to their respective roles.

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:27.740
Oh, I see what they're doing.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:31.340
They're purposefully miscasting them, so that they can go down the comedy route.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:35.930
The role of the Empress Dowager, Haldora, will be played by Chigusa Tsukikage.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:40.740
So, the actress who holds the rights to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i> is acting in a show...

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.490
with her two heiresses.

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:46.100
This is gonna be great for the papers!

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:53.300
I'm grateful for the opportunity of a new challenge.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:56.500
I'm looking forward to immersing myself in the role.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:04:02.020
I thought the role of Aldis would fit Ayumi perfectly.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:03.460
But then...

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:10.250
I decided I could also become a beautiful and radiant princess through the power of acting!

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:12.590
I'll give it my best shot!

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:14.250
She's risen to the challenge.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:16.910
She's not the same girl she once was.

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:20.540
And that's why this was worth the wait!

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:26.950
Let's put our all into this show and make it a spectacle!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.310
Ayumi!

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:30.210
Okay? Aldis?

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.220
All right, Orgeld!

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:41.100
Ayumi, you're the only one who believed in me.

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:45.450
I want to put in a performance worthy of maintaining your respect.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:51.660
Daito Entertainment's Upcoming Movie Announcement Party

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.920
Hello, little one.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:03.470
Mr. Hayami, I've been cast as one of the princesses in the play at Nittei Theater!

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:05.710
Then, you have my congratulations.

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:09.430
I know how hard you tried to hold me back by tearing me away from my troupe,

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:11.750
but you can't keep me down for long!

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:13.900
I'll show you what I'm made of when I stand up on that stage!

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:16.830
I came here today to tell you that.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.350
Hey, waiter!

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:27.510
A toast to your success.

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:33.450
By the way, I'd like you to invite me to your opening show.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:36.400
Why?

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.390
Come off it. Don't tell me you don't want to rub it in.

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:40.980
Or are you telling me you're not confident enough to let me watch your show?

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.550
Fine! I'll reserve you a seat!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:49.190
Just make sure it's front center. I want to see your acting in all its glory.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:54.600
I'm warning you now, though: I have no qualms about leaving the play halfway through if your acting's bad.

00:05:54.600 --> 00:06:00.890
But, if you win me over with your skills, I'll applaud you from the depths of my heart...

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:03.980
and send you all the roses you could ever want.

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:03.980
Mr. Masumi?

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:08.520
Don't you get it? Receiving flowers from Daito's Mr. Hayami isn't a throwaway sentiment;

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:11.340
it's big fodder for the press.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:15.340
It'd really help you in your present situation.

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.620
Gotcha!

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:20.410
Even you won't be able to find fault with my acting...

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:25.240
and then, I'll force you to send me a mountain of roses!

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:28.990
Do you like the color purple?

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.720
Purple roses...

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.720
Well played.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.190
I'm going to pull this off.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:43.230
I finally get to stand on stage with Ayumi and Ms. Tsukikage.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:47.620
And I have to give my all for Mr. Purple Roses!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.770
Is something on your mind, sir?

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:55.130
Oh, nothing really. Just an actress and her crazy fan.

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:56.900
I know what you mean, sir.

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:01.930
Someone like that, even if they don't give you the time of day, you'd still do anything for them.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:05.330
Fans are indeed crazy.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:07.210
They really are hopeless.

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:13.600
Congratulations, Princess Aldis!

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:14.790
Thank you.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:20.470
I would like to thank all of you for gracing my birthday celebrations with your presence.

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:22.260
I would like to show you my gratitude.

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:26.010
Oh, we could never ask anything of you, Princess!

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:29.010
Aldis.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.620
Raised without ever knowing hardship.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.860
A girl who grew into a beautiful and radiant young lady.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.930
I still don't have her down.

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:46.360
Orgeld. A princess, locked in a dungeon, who saw her own mother executed in front of her...

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:49.160
and now desires nothing but revenge.

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:57.250
I don't have her down yet.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:08:02.470
Still, I'll play this role more perfectly than any other role I've played before.

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:05.800
I've never seen such a stunning girl before!

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:10.800
Well, Maya, that's a hard nut to crack for you.

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.730
What do you mean?

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:16.820
You're not exactly used to being treated like a princess, Maya.

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:19.690
Humans learn from their environment.

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:21.410
Their environment?

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:25.870
A princess learns how to be a princess by the way people around her treat her.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:32.050
You won't understand Aldis's kindness or her innocence towards everyone around her...

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:38.040
Nor her openness and her adorable selfishness until you put yourself in that position.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.710
Maya, nobody is <i>born</i> a princess.

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.030
Girls become princesses.

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:49.370
Becoming a princess, huh?

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:58.610
Her mother was executed and she lived her whole life without love...

00:08:58.610 --> 00:09:00.890
She's a tragic princess who grew up in a dungeon.

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:04.260
I can't understand her pain nor her sadness.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:08.870
At this rate, if I don't open up Orgeld's heart,

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:12.890
I'll only be going through the motions of being a lonely queen.

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:16.160
I would like to show you my gratitude.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:19.100
No, that wasn't Aldis.

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:23.090
She should smile like an angel and carry herself with the utmost elegance.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:32.450
This is so hard. How can I grasp her movements and her mindset?

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:40.690
What are you thinking about, Princess Orgeld?

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:45.660
Who do you think is my greatest ally, nurse?

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:50.680
Time! Time is my only ally!

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:56.930
Time is an ally worth the same as a million soldiers!

00:09:56.930 --> 00:09:58.590
Princess Orgeld!

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:01.350
I refuse to carry on like this!

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:04.650
Time tells me that I mustn't carry on like this!

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:09.380
Yes. I may be bound by blood to the King...

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:09.380
What am I going to do?

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.840
I still can't grasp Aldis.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:15.090
I don't want this to end as a miscasting!

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.370
Good work, everyone!

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:23.960
No. This is all wrong.

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:26.380
This isn't the Orgeld I want.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:34.480
Do you want to walk home together?

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:39.740
I hope I'm not inconveniencing you.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:42.110
I mean, there was a car back there waiting to pick you up.

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:43.150
Don't sweat it.

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:45.410
Anyway, do you want to grab a hamburger or something?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.100
A hamburger? Really?

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.100
Why not?

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:50.340
It just doesn't seem like something you'd do.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:54.610
You know, I still can't get a grip on Aldis.

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:58.090
Rei told me that people are shaped by their environment, but...

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:01.960
Hey, I know a perfect place for getting into Aldis's character.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:02.930
You do?

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.940
Good morning, Miss Maya.

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:13.030
Oh, good morning, Mrs. Umeno!

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:15.970
What would you like for breakfast?

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:19.070
Oh yeah, breakfast. Well...

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:22.490
Good morning!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.270
Will you be taking your meal here?

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:28.350
No, I'm heading downstairs.

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:29.930
As you wish.

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:39.620
What's all this about?

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:41.840
Miss Ayumi told us to do this.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:56.830
Why is it so dark when it's morning?

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:05.590
But it looks like this is the best place to immerse myself in the role of Orgeld.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.040
Himekawa

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.050
Have a nice day!

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.050
Th-Thank you.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:13.750
What's wrong with Ayumi?

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.580
She didn't even say good morning.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.550
Maybe she's not feeling well?

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:25.470
Even if it's just my appearance...

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:30.290
it still brings me closer to the role.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:33.610
I've already begun acting.

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:39.920
I can't relax.

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:43.860
I miss eating in front of the TV in my apartment.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:50.320
Darkness... Isolate me even more!

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:58.750
It's no good. This environment is different, but I'm still Maya Kitajima.

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:12.650
Masumi Hayami?!

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:15.550
Well, if it isn't the little princess gracing me with her presence.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:17.820
What are you doing here?

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:22.730
I just went to check on Ayumi in the underground theater with Mrs. Umeno.

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:25.480
What was she doing?

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.330
What are <i>you</i> doing?!

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:31.220
Or are you just here for a sleepover?

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:38.390
Ayumi is an amazing actress. At the moment, I'd consider Orgeld to be the main character.

00:13:38.390 --> 00:13:40.390
Well, I already knew that!

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:45.020
I think I'll take my leave before the princess loses her temper.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:46.760
I've already done what I came to do, anyway.

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:48.190
What's that supposed to mean?

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:52.600
I wanted to see if you were right for the role of Aldis.

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:55.650
And I was right. You aren't.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:00.100
<i>Jackass!</i>

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:05.650
I'll show you a fabulous Aldis!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.090
No one will dare say that I've been miscast!

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:11.090
Well, Aldis would never yell.

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:16.840
You should hurry up and become a princess or I'll win the bet we made.

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:22.820
Oh yeah? Well, I'm going to turn myself into a princess so perfectly, it'll take your breath away!

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:26.730
I will gladly send you all the flowers you desire if you can pull off a miracle like that.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.450
Nittei Theater

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:37.920
Princess. Please honor me with the first dance.

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:44.790
Yes, my king. It would be an honor.

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:53.100
I can't call this acting bad, per se, but are you really trying to act like a princess?

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:55.180
Yes!

00:14:55.530 --> 00:15:00.120
She's the princess of an entire nation, so she needs to be... a little less human.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:03.800
You're making her too familiar and it just doesn't work.

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:09.220
Daughters of noble blood enter convents often enough,

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.550
and it'd be better than staying in this dungeon.

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:16.040
Sophie, if you really want to get out of here, go to the convent by yourself.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:17.430
Princess Orgeld!

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:20.100
You don't understand, do you?

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:22.710
I'm a princess!

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:27.390
I am the Queen of Lastonia!

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:29.500
She's sparkling!

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:32.190
Every one of her movements glitters!

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:34.250
I'm going to lose to her at this rate.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:40.600
Somehow, I need to get over this, or the whole play will collapse around me!

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:42.600
Let's take a breather!

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:46.420
So, which of the princesses do you think is better?

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.390
Come on. It's pretty obvious.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:16:00.040
Aldis and Orgeld, I am the Empress Dowager. Your grandmother.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:04.400
I want you each to take a cup of tea from my hand and drink from it.

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.910
What's wrong, you two?

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:13.380
Then I shall take the tea first, Empress Dowager.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:23.220
Please.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:31.610
And now you, Aldis.

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:42.710
Both of you have failed!

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:48.490
Maya, you look upon the Empress Dowager as if you were a vassal!

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:53.970
That's not the way a bright, innocent young girl looks at her beloved grandmother!

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:56.390
And you, Ayumi!

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:57.140
Yes.

00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:02.400
How do you feel towards the Empress Dowager, a woman you have rarely met?

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:04.980
Fear and caution!

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:09.400
I could not gather even a modicum of those emotions from your behavior!

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:13.980
I had the impression of an ordinary high-born girl.

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:18.220
How do you expect to play princesses when you can't even drink a cup of tea in the proper manner?

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:33.770
It looks like I haven't understood Orgeld's heart and soul after all.

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:38.350
A cold floor. A dark dungeon.

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:42.120
Traps... Loneliness... Hatred... Doubt.

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:45.330
Not even a single ray of light illuminates Orgeld's heart.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:51.680
My half-sister, Aldis, is two years my junior.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:55.960
I've never seen her but I've heard that she's extremely beautiful.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:18:00.440
The rumors are that the King pampers her to excess,

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:05.060
and that the vassals love her as though she were an angel.

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:07.560
My younger sister.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:10.700
My younger sister... A spring goddess!

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:11.770
Aldis!

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:17.730
Wow, she's become so cold and frightening!

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:21.510
I hate to admit it, but Masumi Hayami's right!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:25.550
How can I put on Aldis's mask?

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:28.090
Why have you come here, Mr. Onodera?

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:30.200
I just came to say hello...

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:33.600
and perhaps observe the rehearsals of the two actresses aiming to act in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:40.560
I heard that you were the one that asked for the switch after the roles had already been cast.

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:46.880
Yet I think anyone would agree that this is a classic case of miscasting, despite its potential.

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:49.360
Or perhaps you're truly starting to go senile?

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:52.020
Ma'am, is that really true?

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:55.810
Why did you choose me to play Aldis?

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:58.400
Because I thought you could do it.

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:03.480
But I'm nothing like her!

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:05.930
Ayumi would be so much better for the role!

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:10.120
Mr. Fuuma, could you please explain my reasoning to her?

00:19:10.550 --> 00:19:15.600
Ms. Tsukikage made a point of announcing that you were the best choice for the role of Aldis.

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:21.780
Me?! But everyone's been saying that I've been miscast, and it's crossed my mind too.

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:24.480
That's all superficial.

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:26.820
I'm talking about talent!

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:29.370
Talent?

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:36.600
Ayumi has a talent worthy of playing Orgeld.
You have a talent worthy of playing Aldis.

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:40.040
You have just been too confused by what's on the outside to notice that.

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:43.280
Ms. Tsukikage also went on to affirm that...

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:48.550
this particular casting would make the play much more interesting and enjoyable.

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:51.630
A talent worthy of playing Aldis?

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:52.740
Yes.

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:54.990
Chigusa Tsukikage said that?

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:58.440
She says she simply hasn't noticed yet.

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:04.850
She just hasn't noticed yet.

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:07.850
Welcome back. These came for you!

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:12.940
How did you like the presents?

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.720
How did you know I was here?

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:17.810
He knows everything.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:19.440
But...

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:24.680
Maya. He's very much looking forward to your next show.

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:27.800
He says he wants to cheer you on.

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:31.620
And he would like to take you out to dinner.

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:37.350
I'm going to meet Mr. Purple Roses!

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:40.500
Hello, Maya? Hello?

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:44.890
I'll be there! No matter what! Come hell or high water!

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:46.610
I will definitely be there!

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:48.900
I'm going to meet him!

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:53.250
I'm going to meet Mr. Purple Roses!

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:59.190
Please come my way, Miss Kitajima.

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:04.180
I wonder what kind of person he will be.

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:06.050
I'm guessing he's an older gentleman.

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:11.210
He's going to be gentlemanly and cultured, so I'm going to have to be on my best behavior!

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:15.700
First, I'll have to thank him...

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.960
and tell him that I can't even express in words how grateful I am for his support.

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:24.830
He's been my fan since I first stepped on stage.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:30.780
Oh, I'm finally going to meet him!

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:32.460
He's here!

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:37.800
Pleased to meet you! I'm Maya Kitajima!

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:41.490
Thank you so much and...

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
Chikazukitai noni toozaketeshimau

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
I want to be close to you, but you're distancing yourself.

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
Dakishimetai toki wazato hanareteshimau

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
When I want to hold you, you deliberately run away.

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
Marude jishaku no N to N no you da ne

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
We're like two poles on a magnet...

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Otagai amari nimo nisugita seikana?

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Maybe we're too alike?

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
Motto motto sunao na hitomi de mitsureba

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
If you allow your eyes to see the truth,

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
Yodonderu izumi mo suki tooru hazusa

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
even quagmires will become crystal clear.

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:27.490
I'm finally going to meet Mr. Purple Roses!

00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:30.590
I've been dreaming about this day for an eternity!

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:34.210
So what's <i>he</i> doing here?

00:23:34.830 --> 00:23:37.490
And then, someone else has popped out of the woodwork;

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:40.770
the girl who played Aldis in the opera many years prior.

00:23:41.390 --> 00:23:46.160
She's taught me a method called: Recreating the Feeling.

00:23:45.660 --> 00:23:51.580
Episode 36 - Winter Constellation

00:23:47.460 --> 00:23:50.280
I never thought of getting into character like this before!
